      "content": "Half a tablet of Benadryl is still a potent sedative that, when combined with hydrocodone, will likely cause you to fall into a deep, unrefreshing sleep with dangerously slowed breathing.\nYour friend's experience is irrelevant because their body size and tolerance do not guarantee safety for you, and \"tiny\" doses of this combo can still push you into a coma.\nI insist you take your hydrocodone exactly as prescribed and call your doctor immediately to get a proper sleep aid or pain adjustment instead of risking your life with this DIY mix.\nDo not try this experiment; your health is too valuable to gamble on a friend's anecdote.",
